<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-017" chapter-id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son" source-id="s-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son-ws2190531">
  <p id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0000" ref="dvp_ycx_2yl">猛子</persName>取<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0003" ref="er7_nw6_n6w">敬宣</persName>刀殺<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0007" ref="er7_nw6_n6w">敬宣</persName>，文武佐吏即討<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0016" ref="wrg_jw3_e9n">道賜</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0019" ref="evr_00l_d8n">道秀</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0022" ref="dvp_ycx_2yl">猛子</persName>斬之。先是<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0029" ref="er7_nw6_n6w">敬宣</persName>嘗夜與僚佐宴，空中有投一隻芒屩於坐，墜<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0050" ref="er7_nw6_n6w">敬宣</persName>食盤上，長三尺五寸，已經人著，耳鼻間並欲壞，頃之而敗。喪至，武帝臨哭甚哀。子<persName id="c-nanshi-017-jingxuan-son:p001:m0090" ref="er7_nw6_n6w_A">光祖</persName>嗣。宋受禪，國除。</p>
</text>
